Zhongjun's python script for pointsto mrc conversion

(1) download both into one directory
(2) i3new -s 320 320 320 -fmt mrc finalpos.mrc
(3) ./pos_paste.py  file.pos  finalpos.mrc small2.mrc
(4) proc3d finalpos.mrc filalpos_en2.mrc scale=2 clip=640,640,640
(5) proc3d filalpos_en2.mrc filalpos_en2_lp100.mrc lp=100

explaination:

1.  currently, the program only accept postive number
2. size (320) should be larger than your max coordinate in pos file
3. small2.mrc is a 3X3X3 cubic dhensity map
